<title>POLAND: DEBICA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 7.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>DEBICA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 7.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.64 vs   6.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.87 vs   9.82</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.24 vs   9.74</p>
<p> Sales		   64.02 vs  55.44</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    27.16 vs  18.70</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	39.39 vs  27.06</p>
<p> Operating profit    25.72 vs  28.82</p>
<p> Sales		  228.96 vs 190.29</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is TC Debica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
